name: Cold restart preserves explicit Map selection, zoom and return
size: 120x36
cwd: @TMP_TARGET
env-unset: ANTHROPIC_API_KEY OPENAI_API_KEY KUZUSHI_MODEL KUZUSHI_LANGGRAPH_BRIDGE NODE_OPTIONS NO_COLOR
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/dfd_connectivity.py @TMP_TARGET @ART seed
require-wrapper-flow:
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | ready
submit: run threat-model:import {"path":"ctx.json","activate":true}
require-live-snap: 30 threat-model:import saved | imported
submit: map
require-live-snap: 25 2 components have no recorded flows | map-review
nav-mode:
keys: u
require-live-snap: 25 Map ✓ | accepted
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/dfd_connectivity.py @TMP_TARGET @ART accepted
keys: G
require-live-snap: 25 application · 5/5 | selected-summary
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 DETAIL · node 5/8 | embedded-detail
expect: Viewing Map
expect: Principal definition
expect-not: KUZUSHI VIZ
keys: z
require-live-snap: 25 KUZUSHI VIZ · DATA-FLOW DIAGRAM | zoomed-detail
expect: Principal definition
expect: NAVIGATION MODE
expect: No incoming or outgoing
ask: Does explicit zoom show the same Principal component in the full-frame DFD, with navigation ownership and readable recorded-flow uncertainty?
keys: q
require-live-snap: 25 Viewing Map | returned-detail
expect: Principal definition
expect: DETAIL · node 5/8
expect-not: KUZUSHI VIZ
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME NO_COLOR=1 KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | restarted
submit: map
require-live-snap: 25 2 components have no recorded flows | restarted-summary
nav-mode:
keys: G
require-live-snap: 25 application · 5/5 | restarted-selected-summary
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 DETAIL · node 5/8 | restarted-embedded-detail
expect: Viewing Map
expect: Principal definition
expect-not: KUZUSHI VIZ
keys: z
require-live-snap: 25 KUZUSHI VIZ · DATA-FLOW DIAGRAM | restarted-zoomed-detail
expect: Principal definition
expect: NAVIGATION MODE
expect: No incoming or outgoing
ask: Does no-color restart reach the full-frame DFD only after the explicit zoom key, without changing component identity, accepted context or input ownership?
keys: q
require-live-snap: 25 Viewing Map | restarted-returned-detail
expect: Principal definition
expect: DETAIL · node 5/8
expect-not: KUZUSHI VIZ
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/dfd_connectivity.py @TMP_TARGET @ART restarted
ask: Does Back restore the embedded Map DFD and the same selected component after restart, with no saved work or provider requests?
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
